<title>LEBANON: Lebanese money market rates - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese money market rates - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lebanese Banks Association issued the following money market details on Thursday:</p>
<p>Market in Lebanese pounds:</p>
<p>					   Dec 96   Jan 97   Feb 97</p>
<p> Average rate on Deposits (%)     14.69    14.07     n.a.</p>
<p> Estimated interest spread	   2.79     3.32     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Estimated interest spread does not take into account operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>Market in Foreign Exchange:</p>
<p> Average rate on Deposits (%)	5.62     5.58     n.a.</p>
<p> Estimated interest spread	   3.34     3.36     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Estimated interest spread does not take into account operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>-- Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057  745307  745308</p>
</text>
